# SET-PIECE (M18 phase 0): crossfire.
#
# A composition, which is the whole reason layer 2 exists: two gaps split the
# deck into three lanes, a half wall stands where somebody crossing the middle
# lane can use it, and a turret past the gaps covers all three. No distribution
# over "gap density" produces that -- the interesting part is the RELATIONSHIP
# between the cover and the thing it is cover from, and a relationship has to be
# authored once and then reused.
#
# Solo-crossable by any of the three lanes. The outer two are longer and out of
# the turret's best angle; the middle one is short and watched. That IS the
# decision the piece is for.
#
# The entry and exit rows are full-width solid deck, which is the join contract
# one level down: the generator stamps this at whatever plateau it has reached,
# and both ends have to meet ordinary ground.

name = piece_crossfire
base_height = 0
width = 21
length = 6
piece_exit = 0
tags = foot, piece, firefight

